<BaseLayout title="Editorial Policy"><section class="container prose-page"><h1>Editorial policy</h1><h2>Safety and sources</h2><p>We aim to use authoritative veterinary and feline-welfare sources for cat-care claims, clearly identify illustrations, and explain where individual needs may differ.</p><h2>What we do not claim</h2><p>We do not describe products as independently tested, veterinarian-approved or personally used without documented evidence. Paid partnerships and affiliate relationships must be disclosed.</p><h2>Corrections</h2><p>Material corrections should be dated and explained. Each article must pass source verification and safety review before its status is changed to published.</p><div class="notice">Draft: publisher, owner, corrections contact and external-review process must be verified before launch.</div></section></BaseLayout>
